The IBM i driver is the Identity Manager 4.8 driver for IBM i (AS/400) that is part of the Identity Manager Integration Module 4.8 for Midrange. Its distribution package, found in the /bidirectional/AS400 folder, includes three files: 
- Metadirectory/i5os.xml – a driver rules file used to create the driver object on the Metadirectory server; 
- Metadirectory/i5os.sch – a schema extension file that adds auxiliary classes to User and Group objects for IBM i profile and distribution directory attributes; 
- i5osdrv.sav – the driver shim distribution package.
